Do you think we could reuse the existing `RedactedValue()` func here instead of defining our own terms?
https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/c021b5e06432b889c9381ec7f338de2cde416e30/pkg/setting/setting.go#L971
```suggestion
func isSecretField(key string, value string) bool {
	if _, ok := secretExceptions[key]; ok {
		return false
	}
	return value != setting.RedactedValue(key, value)
}
